====================================================================
  COARSE APPROACH -- this moves a real tip toward a real sample
====================================================================
  port              COM3
  Z direction       UNKNOWN: Z parks at 32768 for every motor step and
                    searches toward 10000 and toward 50000 each cycle
  motor step        -1 per cycle, up to 400 steps (~3.1 um)

  BEFORE YOU CONTINUE:
   - LED1 to LED4 must be DARK. If any is lit the DACs have lost
     configuration, every Z command below does nothing, and the
     motor would advance with no piezo protection at all.
   - Nobody within a metre of the preamp.
   - Ctrl-C stops at any time and sends Z to midscale.


  Measuring baseline with Z at midscale...
  baseline 22 counts, noise 159 counts RMS (0.50 nA)
  threshold 1500 counts (4.69 nA) of deviation either way
  A high threshold costs almost no depth: tunneling current rises
  about 10x per Angstrom, so 6 nA is under an Angstrom past 1 nA.

